# Lectum Builder Root Rules

Do not generate product UI from the repository root.

This repository contains separate `frontend/` and `backend/` apps only for local development. Builder visual/code operations must target the frontend app explicitly:

```bash
cd frontend
npx "@builder.io/dev-tools@1.79.0" code --url vcp://quickcopy/vcp-24aaa2941d814e5b90572bc93ae50e2a --cwd .
```

Treat Builder output as a visual draft. Never accept generated code as final without applying `_product/tasks/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `_product/tasks/PACKAGES.md`, and the target task file.

Do not create or modify backend code, task documents, ADRs, MCP config, AI-agent instructions, package manifests, lockfiles, auth/session code, API callers, stores, validators, or response helpers from Builder generation.
